# basic_rag

Stack: FastAPI (`main.py`) + Streamlit (`frontend/`) + LangGraph RAG + Chroma + SQLite FTS5 + JWT.

Do not change unless the task says so:
- Chat: `POST /chat/`, SSE events `token` / `done`
- One pipeline only: multi-agent supervisor over hybrid retrieval. No mode switch, no basic-RAG path
- Session ids stay `session_<uuid>`
- Streamlit chat UX

Work rules:
- Edit existing files; do not invent paths, class names, or deps
- One concern per change; small functions, not new class trees
- Config from `Settings` / `.env` — never commit secrets
- Type-hint functions; no mutable defaults; no bare `except:`
- `logging`, not `print`; parameterize SQL
- Skip Django/Next.js patterns; this is not those stacks
- Do not paste `PROJECT_WORKFLOW.md` or the fix plan into new files
